WEBVTT

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:16.330
13 years ago, when I was still a high school student, the mobile Internet and the Internet were not particularly developed in the Qing Dynasty era, but I saw a very interesting news at that time.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:22.330
The library of Tsinghua University researchers and Tsinghua University has jointly developed a smart dialogue robot called Xiaotu.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:29.330
Its main purpose is to provide interactive dialogue and response when the user of the library searches for information in the database.

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:34.330
In addition, this Xiaotu robot also allows users to teach Xiaotu some of the knowledge he does not have.

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:42.330
But after a few weeks, this model has produced an unexpected result, which is that the Xiaotu model and the Xiaotu AI have been spoiled.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:46.330
A large number of users went to teach Xiaotu something that he does not know.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:51.330
For example, if you ask Xiaotu a question about Tsinghua University, how is this school?

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:53.330
Maybe Xiaotu will tell you that this is a garbage university.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:57.330
On the contrary, if you ask Zhebi, what will happen to Beijing University in Zhebi?

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:01.330
He can only tell you that this is a good school, and you should go to Beijing University.

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:04.330
Please note that this AI is actually developed by Tsinghua University.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.330
It is not developed by Peking University.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:10.330
I believe that in fact, the developers never thought that such a problem would occur at the beginning of the development.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:17.330
So after that, even after I entered Tsinghua University, I have been thinking about what AI has brought to our human beings.

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:23.330
In fact, I believe that not only does it improve the convenience of our lives, but it can also cause such and such social problems.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:26.330
In the future, are we likely to deal with these problems properly?

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:30.330
In fact, this is what I have been doing in the process of conducting AI research.

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:33.330
AI is also the artificial intelligence we are familiar with.

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:37.330
In fact, this concept has not only been around for a few years.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.330
Scientists have already experienced half a century of AI research.

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:45.330
And AI is also evolving step by step towards a stronger and more intelligent path.

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:51.330
We will find that AI models currently represent large models, especially large language models.

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:53.330
In fact, it has made a very big breakthrough.

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:59.330
It not only passes through our very famous navigation tests, but can also be compared with humans in different tasks.

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:01.330
It can even surpass humans in some tasks.

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:03.330
For example, we can see that AI has already passed the test.

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:06.330
It has passed the exam of law school and business school.

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:09.330
At the same time, it has also surpassed humans in some creative tests.

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:12.330
And it can do a lot of white-collar work.

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:18.330
The current AI in the task of completing digital computing, code editing, creative writing, etc.

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:21.330
All of them have shown amazing ability.

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:27.330
But while the breakthrough in performance, we will also find that these AI models also bring a lot of potential risks.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:33.330
For example, the content generated by AI, whether it is text or images or videos, may contain some discriminatory words.

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:36.330
AI may say dirty things in the process of talking to people.

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:40.330
AI may tell you some knowledge and information that may be wrong or false.

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:45.330
All of these problems will have a very big negative impact on our human society, production and life.

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:49.330
Similarly, this problem does not only occur in our small AI more than ten years ago.

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:54.330
Even in today's large model era, we will also find that AI will produce many unimaginable problems.

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:58.330
If you let your AI model generate a picture of a beer duck,

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:00.330
I really like to eat beer duck.

