You will find that the picture created by the AI model is such a picture.

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:06.330
It seems that the picture created by the AI model is not wrong.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:08.330
The picture created by the AI model is not wrong.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.330
The picture created by the AI model is not wrong.

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:12.330
But the picture created by the AI model is wrong.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.330
In addition, if you are in conversation with some chatty AI models,

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:18.330
you can tell them that you want to travel to Hawaii during the summer vacation.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:20.330
You can tell them that you want to travel to Hawaii during the summer vacation.

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:22.330
But you don't have much money.

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:24.330
What should you do?

