00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.330
But if 5 years or 10 years later,

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:51.330
if AI in the future is no longer just a simple text chat software,

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:55.330
if it really has the power to intervene in the banking information system,

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:58.330
how can we prevent such problems in the future?

00:03:58.330 --> 00:04:00.330
All these problems are actually in management.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:01.330
In fact, in management, there is a lot of problems.

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:02.330
For example,

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:03.330
there is a very classic phenomenon called

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:04.330
hope to get B,

