00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:18.330
This is also one of the sources of many problems that AI has produced at the moment.

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:19.330
We believe that in the future,

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:22.330
AI will be more and more integrated into our daily lives.

00:04:22.330 --> 00:04:25.330
It is not just a tool to help us complete our tasks.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.330
At the same time, it may also be our partner.

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:28.330
It may also be our friend.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.330
In such a deep interaction,

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:32.330
any problem caused by AI

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.330
may have a very serious impact on the order of our human society

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:36.330
and the development of human beings.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.330
We need to take full control of all the risks.

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:41.330
This entire research direction is what we call

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:42.330
Responsible AI,

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:45.330
that is, responsible human intelligence.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:47.330
In fact, this research direction is not only

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:49.330
in our modern model era.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:50.330
A decade ago,

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:51.330
even decades ago,

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:53.330
scientists were already in charge of

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:56.330
monitoring, evaluating and solving the problems caused by AI.

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:58.330
But the solutions proposed in the past

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:59.330
are not suitable for our current model.

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:01.330
Why?

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:03.330
Because there are two very big characteristics

00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:05.330
of AI represented by the current model.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:07.330
The first characteristic is called the anti-difference law.

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:10.330
It means that if your AI model is bigger and stronger,

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.330
the consequences will be more serious

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.330
as soon as problems occur.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.330
The second characteristic is called risk tolerance.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.330
In other words, when our AI is strong to a certain extent,

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:21.330
it may cause problems that we have never found before.

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:23.330
In fact, seven or eight years ago,

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:27.330
we had already conducted research on AI in Tsinghua University.

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:29.330
At that time, we designed an AI

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:32.330
to automatically create AI programs and software for poems.

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:35.330
This software can generate a Chinese main poem

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:37.330
with a harmonious and beautiful

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.330
