00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.330
But AI in that era could only write poems

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:42.330
and could not carry out any other tasks.

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:43.330
But on the contrary,

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:45.330
the current AI may teach you how to steal

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:47.330
under the requirements of the user,

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:50.330
how to illegally evade

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:51.330
or illegally evade taxes.

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:52.330
All these behaviors

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.330
have never been seen in the past.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.330
So we can also expect that

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:57.330
in the future,

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:58.330
as AI becomes more powerful,

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.330
we may face or experience more problems

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.330
that we cannot imagine at the moment.

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:04.330
These two characteristics

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:06.330
make the methods we have developed

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:08.330
for AI security

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:09.330
unable to be used anymore.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:11.330
If we don't add any control,

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.330
all the models we used to design

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:14.330
will actually be unable to

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:15.330
cover more and more

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:17.330
and more serious problems in our future.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.330
Maybe we solved a problem,

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.330
and another new problem will arise.

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:21.330
We solved a small problem,

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:23.330
