00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.330
All these AI risks in the age of big models

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.330
are asking for or calling for

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.330
a unified method

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.330
that allows us to avoid

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.330
AI not only now,

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.330
but also the risks that may occur in the future.

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.330
But fortunately,

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:46.330
in fact,

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:47.330
60 years ago,

00:06:47.330 --> 00:06:48.330
in the 60s of the last century,

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:49.330
the very famous

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.330
rich man of control theory,

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:51.330
Robert Wiener,

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:53.330
