00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:15.190
In order to answer these three questions, we have carried out or carried out research for more than a year and obtained some preliminary results.

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:19.190
First of all, for the first question, we actually adopted an intersectional research method.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:24.190
We adopted the Schwartz value theory system proposed and used in social psychology.

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:31.190
This value point theory defines ten different basic values, such as power, achievement, tradition, safety, and so on.

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:36.190
Each of our value points can be seen as the embodiment and combination of these ten basic value points.

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:42.190
After we have observed and evaluated more than ten or even hundreds of AI models and AI configurations of different variables,

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:45.190
we have created such a basic value point.

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:50.190
In the space of the value point, we can clearly observe that the potential value of AI

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:55.190
