00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:59.190
The risk behavior of AI with different value points is different.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:03.190
The risk degree of AI with different value points is also different.

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:09.190
We actually found that the value point of AI can not only help us evaluate the risk degree of the model at the moment,

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:14.190
but it can even help us predict the risks that AI may encounter in the future.

00:12:14.190 --> 00:12:16.190
When we observed the value point of AI,

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:19.190
